  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You call on Hadar, and dark tendrils burst out of you. Each creature in a 10-foot Emanation around you makes a Strength saving throw. On a failure, it takes 2d6 Necrotic damage and can’t take Reactions until the start of its next turn; on a success, it only takes half as much damage.</p><p><strong>Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.</strong> The damage increases by 1d6 for each spell slot level above 1.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-HjnbQzRimhuA3u1X\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>The effect marks the creatures that can’t take Reactions.</p></section>",
      "chat": ""
    },
